        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Helpful and friendly. The product is excellent and good value. I installed myself and the instructions were concise, clear and easy to follow. With new 2025 pool security regulations in Quebec, this product is a cost effective solution.",
        "time": 1694456721,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tannaz ghaffari",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112345652591855871276/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUinuekk1bS0b7ZQFAhqc0oFPFz5gtPHhbVQcrX8ne5XVz1FE4B=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I don't know from where comes all the positive reviews!!  They keep me waiting for over two months. I got an estimate from two of their people with difference of 800!!! and if you ask why they simply say that's what it is! So basically their distributor can charge what ever they want and the company is not responsible and protecting you at all! although I trust the company and called not individual distributor! So don't do my mistake and don't trust the reviews, is wasting time and money .",
        "time": 1621438655,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jamie Roy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115203111510068537442/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUXcuTKBZky8MjDgDnkACbpe06gR7xHgrtp6r3daObYkMG0k-yyPw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "I needed some extra parts for my existing fence and the team was able to pull together my order quickly.  Fast and Friendly.",
        "time": 1747147309,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mazdak Azmoodeh Ardalan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101601194200867078705/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLdlsjg53cmVouhIif4D6hsHyXRUkIfXZVQTfai-6DoVvrSuQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Great price, great product and great service. We moved to a home with existing holes for the posts so the lengths had to match precisely the layout. EnfantSecure was very helpful over the phone to guide in purchasing the exact fit. Installation was a breeze and pool is secure. Highly recommended!",
        "time": 1552652925,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "David Chan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109523104029601449997/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWMh-lvSMrQ4Rp-TpH75Xydl7PEHlRse3gy85EQoxzm7xBgZfUU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Dannis Rathé  - Détaillant Autorisé from SÉCURITÉ M-TECK comes highly recommended.  We were rushing to have the fence completed while we were away in Italy so that my daughter and granddaughter were able to use the backyard while we were away.  Dannis completed the installation as promised in quick time and even messaged me a picture of the installed fence - what a great surprise.  Thank you Dannis for the amazing service and professional installation.  The best !!!",
        "time": 1687798094,
        "translated": false
      }
